o or review the audio script, study the visual asset concept, then complete the linked mission task or AEGIS scenario response.","Mission Task Prompt":"Translate the source into a concrete mission decision, architecture judgment, or research gap statement.","Dash Deliverable":"2-page memo or 6-slide commander brief uploaded in Dash.","Evaluation Focus":"Systems thinking, mission relevance, trust-and-assurance reasoning, decision communication, and evidence quality."},"research":{"Source ID":"M32","Research Vector":"Research how doctrine and strategic guidance account for trusted data, cyber resilience, and commercial integration in actual decision chains.","Master''s-Level Option":"20-30 page applied research paper or design study linked to a weekly work plan and AEGIS scenario.","PhD / Publication Option":"Publication-oriented manuscript on the unresolved trust, assurance, architecture, or workforce issue surfaced by the source.","Cross-Links / Best-Fit Pathways":"Trusted AI & Autonomy"}}'::jsonb) on conflict (id) do update set title=excluded.title, official_source=excluded.official_source, tier=excluded.tier, domain=excluded.domain, theme=excluded.theme, pathways=excluded.pathways, core_selective=excluded.core_selective, public_url=excluded.public_url, phase2=excluded.phase2, content=excluded.content, updated_at=now();
